# Keep the CLI upload small and free of secrets.
backend/.venv
backend/.env
backend/tests
frontend/node_modules
frontend/dist
**/__pycache__
*.db
render.yaml
CLAUDE.md
docs/handbook
# With its twin, never alone: check-mirrors 33 compares the two and treats one
# present without the other as a moved file, so it would fail the Vercel build.
AGENTS.md

# Competitor UI reference captures. .vercelignore SUPERSEDES .gitignore for CLI
# uploads, so the .gitignore rule does not cover this path here -- without this
# line a `vercel deploy` ships 65 screenshots of the owner`s resume to the build.
reference-screenshots
